@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="mb-4">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">
            Student Marks Management System
        </p>
        <hr />
    </div>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Welcome to the Student Marks Management System.
            This application is designed to help students calculate
            their Developmental Points (DP), determine exam eligibility,
            estimate the marks required to pass or achieve a distinction,
            and calculate their final marks.
        </p>
        <p>
            We value your privacy and aim to be transparent about how
            information entered into this application is handled.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            The calculator allows you to enter module details,
            assessment names, assessment marks, assessment weightings,
            and examination marks.
        </p>
        <p>
            In the current version, the application does not require
            you to create an account or provide your name, student number,
            or email address to use the calculator.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>3. How Your Information Is Used</h2>
        <p>
            Information entered into the calculator is used to perform
            the calculations and display the results you request.
            The application calculates your DP, exam eligibility,
            required examination marks, and final result according
            to its configured rules.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>4. Storage of Results</h2>
        <p>
            The current version does not provide a database or an account
            system for permanently saving your calculations or maintaining
            a personal results history.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you leave or refresh the page, previously entered
            information may no longer be available.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>5. Sharing of Information</h2>
        <p>
            The application does not include a feature for sharing
            your calculated marks with lecturers, institutions,
            or other users.
        </p>
        <p>
            Please avoid entering sensitive personal information
            that is not needed for calculating your marks.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>6. Security and Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
            If the application is hosted online, the hosting provider
            and the infrastructure used to operate the website may
            process technical information, such as server requests
            and diagnostic logs. The handling of that information
            depends on the hosting service and its configuration.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated when the application
            gains new features or its information-handling practices
            change.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
            If you have questions about this application or its
            privacy practices, please use the contact details provided
            by the application's developer, where available.
        </p>
    </section>

    <p class="text-muted small">
        Last updated: 26 October 2026
    </p>
</div>
